Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:56:45 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 13/14] Android: Add AndroidPlatform adapter for LibWeb
 integration

- UI/Android/app/src/main/cpp/AndroidPlatform.{h,cpp}: Android-specific platform adapter for LibWebView
  - AndroidApplication: Singleton managing LibWeb global state, resource loading, font configuration
  - AndroidPlatformAdapter: Font loading from /system/fonts/, image decoding (Skia/BitmapFactory), timer scheduling
  - Stubs for LibCore::EventLoop, Web::Bindings, Android asset/font loading (to be implemented when LibWeb linked)
- LibWebAndroid: Call AndroidApplication::initialize/shutdown in init/shutdown functions
- CMakeLists.txt: Link AndroidPlatform.cpp into both ladybird_android and ladybird_android_bootstrap

Bootstrap APK builds. AndroidApplication initialized on WebContent thread startup. Next: Implement real LibWeb::Page creation after vcpkg manifest.
